m1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="m3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="m0" target="s1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="m1" target="s1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="m2" target="s0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="m3" target="s3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="NOTES
* Running demo today: ONE Container App (mpsdemo-api, 1 replica) in rg-mps-demo holds the web console, API, simulator, agents and mock systems.
* Demo messaging: in-process bus in that container instead of IoT Hub, Event Hubs and Service Bus. Same envelope, so it can be swapped later.
* Demo storage: SQLite on the container plus YAML metadata instead of Azure SQL and Data Explorer; data resets on redeploy by design.
* Not deployed in the demo: Front Door, WAF, API Management, AI Search, separate workers. Deployed: Entra ID, Key Vault, managed identity,
  Container Registry, Azure OpenAI, App Insights and Log Analytics. Deploys run from GitHub Actions with OIDC, no stored cloud secrets." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=19;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=#0B1B33;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1486" width="1580" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tb" value="Meridian Precision Systems · FabOps
